  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "積德之君，仁政且溫。伊呂股肱，國富民安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1e16f26816835d6d2c7be69585612bac0a27d32774563e4c91156867926ba7a8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e5cf7904a9495ec058c9aafe6a2107e50a9a70a2784e314c1d6a4149b682a865"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "頃筐卷耳，憂不能傷。心思古人，悲慕失母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:de97ed6cae5229852de8ec4a96ad1fced19561b45a5ed382eeb28c77be33aa75",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6576c4945fb871f8f0aeec72bc5b61d1173b84131d70884b10f3bd7c24817576"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "郤叔賈貸，行祿多悔，利無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8ede8c798f64aeda0e2eb97ed01a86cc5134e24219a07843f3b5e3b1ccf7ca09",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6300a6f2f65d85dba6d9896e51d5210d1229a494483844d91f339e90054d59c7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "蹙足跛袵，辟坐不行。棄捐平人，名字無中。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:db6af45aebf0e424225416ccb2853d4cc7cf7b3656c450917f9d398771332547",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:df64f6a2e6a192b43211113fbd3b4b4a70d5cc186c95f42644334ff9591868d5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "文王四乳，仁愛篤厚。子畜十男，夭折無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0d744f767711a2820ac790af42152971597598d7abae59648b83a7565ef71374",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:90c65f7981a849f07bcc1e50ce531a353c8954535c49a2ecd3ef2df95ebe2c00"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "容民畜眾，不離其居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:400eb06327c195972a91e65ac5ad17790b355cf0cbbc1b78c23f097a18671138",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9d7c0842506a9301bcbbc761d1110cec04ffd2a5ac33f2886b698aed38971959"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "三雛相逐，蠅墜釜中。灌沸潦殪，與母長決。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ce74fea8c7f87bb9c00b62828168d7c33af8489e5f9cf54587652ee0016393c7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9774e98401225bd00655d13e669e8713e68d532e4c30e53b05fe66b455ac30d7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "所望在外，鼎令方來。拭爵滌罍，炊食待之。不為季憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e431d2460ce89b175e5b6451f53849e3e334a49f0628efdf2852e856362ba0ed",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bfaf6c19c3a555b07efa97179581e7e46479978d30b95066f455e33fdb9d7586"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "陸居少泉，高山無雲。車行千里，塗污爾輪。亦為我患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:77e7965aadc9ae947894a0a5131687736185dd282308016cc7293df7a23fc1aa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:950db3cfbed44781aa5891b2afc9655634a189fca4022a99706b19e1f2c10572"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "東家殺牛，污臰腥臊。神背西顧，命絕衰周。亳社災燒，宋人夷誅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:63c7cf8ad8164f4c5889a6d5614224e0de080fba6cced4835381cff0db5ff379",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:607eecbbade144e6ae0d9c071f14bdad695be7534ca153702e14c6eb4ea73238"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "長子入獄，婦饋母哭。霜降旬日，嚮晦伏法。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:268ff432ba309adf4f01922a2b15cf5da5d21cc594f4b089bd2f508dd4529261",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:957caf82fc701e531a565a3ee7602c2b3567e800d0589fbf7acc0843a1e5b795"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "溫山松柏，常茂不落。鳳凰以庇，得其歡樂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:42ccb32c9014c9a15ecc43778c97c5cb4e0b63cfa875de19f0135e6edf5a4626",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:978e23c75a474968c289ad7c2535a086ad6a55a03db991942c025d2327f0dad0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "大屋之下，朝多君子。德施溥育，宋受其福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d019751f439561adc6f168a156232246185681ccb86e82802aa3529ce376d7ad",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ae6b274b883f9d40126868684f552cc999527428383c7a1bc510de88a625531d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "羅張目列，圍合有缺。採捕無功，魚鳥得脫。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8656c4151fdee0e6d02c358dc7ceb4f87257e0440856e668f12bd0aad22f905b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:90de69b5061a1d6dd11fa34183a3ef0170b46e1bed9f53a7cdc4d99b4e989b52"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "羔裘豹衣，高易我宇。君子惟好，至老無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bc462612e751678c0a3600d3016b17cae11c2279fc004778a8ed96ec279d9602",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fc5f8971d6ede6ee9183c95ae4daae9fed8b907db3968075373cdd0c6d2fa515"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "大頭明目，載受福喜。三雀飛來，與祿相得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e32ce5cc3a0f590ea913ae2ddd930d5208bc4961bb025932a75dbc07fc600728",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:32498f89a97aa0c8d1a92943f51c9883a7c897355deb03a42c1f20fcf3654f31"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "銷鋒鑄耜，縱牛放馬。甲兵解散，夫婦相保。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e749dd911a9c44438093501b7101bc1c452f3572c601fdc71319acdcc7aadcd5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:61247b5c16572b7f9b5aa6f19d9975a357755a02b4b0c38623c474f425bd554b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "吉月車攻，田弋雙禽。宣王飲酒，以告嘉功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:75a56c7b2a4cf2ebfef98cb4903c0fcb53a31b27840e141069aa8442c4112b58",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6a4aab801d396ebf16a5d67c469f82fab7af80279df40bd498e03e1e274eadb8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "商人行旅，資無所有。貪貝逐利，留連王市。轘轅內安，君子何咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b6bb308c8b58d294e25dc4e9fe7d46f5d62b90ff6be3c2554688c627a622699f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:09b96a5d1c1a2b0318195c4a6c2287af3554239e81f748a8a7139c746e923490"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "火入井口，陽芒生角。犯歷天門，窺見太微。登上玉床，家易其公。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:068b298fbe4aff55ca73f876037612b08fa73d811b2634ff7019a578233e6eaf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3d635b71613b39d5785c12ee4eed9337073161d995ea73ea8d8b23ecf4a5df35"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "秋隼冬翔，數被嚴霜。甲兵充庭，萬物不生。雄父夜鳴，民擾大驚。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:27021e9cf66aa9cb0813b16cfeec4cf87a7c9e380cd2bdf5e495c11d2b0215e1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:247e8c9f421efd51a9e8c93600ba7304268a2cbd056b5f074829ae22e7fc4c68"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "東行西步，失其次舍。乾侯野井，昭君喪居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dc5389e282a6642139d3ba35a3ca88179ac0ec3be653c6c77ee2b57c8fadda91",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:37a44a9e045f3a26f67d1788ffbd4277246058d2d31521e9de285d2d2aa01b0a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "腫脛病腹，陷廁污辱。命短時極，孤子哀哭。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e82930a42957356d5a9185eabff44f3ecc78c3f3992b4dbda244e004c196d532",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:51ae13031d9ef8060ad6f0e5a317346575af727c1bf463bf3c75bdac1237ed83"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "切膚近災，虎絕我鬚。小人橫暴，君子何災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9b5548b4b1bccec5057d9a18982324e0f741fe77d21a107ff035e2a07b7fb6d2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1f3850e2a782a3d8ce712aa568be8788cd3e7b8b132dba664a8445fdcdf9c05c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "女室作毒，為我心疾。和弗能治，晉人赴吉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f242a637037484f0b2628ca007d225e618c38eae33d28d19c1b281a5585c55bd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:14f642d75ece108961623dba3fa85af757e2c40da2d6dcfe0baf6442dc7d1e50"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "兵征大宛，北出玉關。與胡寇戰，平城道西。七日絕糧，身幾不全。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dce14f4153dc7208c55a96e5b1c10273c438d00d907beeb8187649339a939fca",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:622b8a36600434adf4c3a467196f323eef462f2ab3080d32f336257aa45d96b9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "十子夫九，莫適與居。貞心不宣，至今名孤。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1317a3522c65932e06c1eaa40c1fb61fd31f1e4cdcfa9ce47e7ee322f08a0957",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6d4a1cd45a87039d9c3aebdd9fd24d11b1385d2b9dac8186f77d8701698d7e7b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "車行稻麥，遂至家國。樂土無災，君子何憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0dcf720a63789e9b801d6ea9577c2b1646a04110695cffaf8c76dae7fbaaf190",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ebf7bf7b7e7915899e6aa7ce1055b11228048829045a7f1de8a8c8670020b919"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "作室山根，所以為安。一夕崩巔，破我饔餐。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6a02401e592ecf26e6c43c3528ddb7cbc24a7ed0db2b51e7fa050efcf61b1baa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b611e08c967e5e706d95683f49047876803d574930378e6c806461a77e7478fa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "六人俱行，各遺其囊。黃鵠失珠，無以為明。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dc9e8a70e630ffbad459abf26af63d7fb82c986bf29bb6536225a585575ce029",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2db66279610034b663bf47662e284f567dffc7aab34ddfb8caa83d553a1048e3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "伯蹇叔盲，莫為守裝。失我衣裘，我是陰邦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d29cff0f459de178ecae746f8c1800fbe48354ca9af1e308dea626ec01fbffde",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f6bf6929c6b6f56facd70971dae3b8554771da35b9bf7a1b2131915b337256a8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "褒寵溢尤，敗政傾家。覆我宗國，秦滅周室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4b5841b3f2e48da0d8713072f4392c9aeb3cdb56b2c464623c321faf4dcc454e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f8086de7609b281ee19b89d0ef2ee667451704c95f15dc5e308b7f88de274802"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "詭言譯語，仇禍相得。冰入炭室，消滅不息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e09505639d58a58409fb941837a922a856997d6334d52b4a39ac555d3bfd6bbf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8919994817831c0d69c42c5e66846b938caa1c7f7dc4475a820ab252b4137399"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "彭生為妖，暴龍作災。盜堯衣裳，聚跖荷兵。青禽照夜，三日夷亡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ad07bc0f7dbb7ecb587480323cf7c533a5f10b8341ffddfb2aa0aa638e379973",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cd0e7012ce3a30295b817664529fd9b3ea49ea02250905cea1dcdc89331bf340"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "朝暮日月，四馬過隙。歲短期促，時難再得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fb4ddeba3584dbbfd72ff1d70b308dde4feabefad49cfcff63829d10e65e71c1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7360a6e14b68ca3bd2a0c9f138a40e8412bf4e71f40f8ae43919ca0840bcd89d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "耳闕道喪，所為不成，所求匪得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6e7af4bcbc9e9d00dafdba2a8111d89ce68a6bc5a38d1a63c20e6b48578c2077",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fbebf73f6cdd63c8c3c3c81d892efa0448c5720cc4556fa88c1861672d61d84b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "申公患楚，危不自安。重耳出奔，側喪其魂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4fccc3f9965858c2035a94ccb88fd30023f3b3489c705bc9dd7dff9058ff3b63",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3d767082bd4566d67fc41207df9e22e38511228b5269cf7442ca44de308c1ba5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "南上泰山，困於空桑。左沙右石，牛馬無食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:432c1eecd20fcdbf610883198f4f0f9e9de180f09941cc0236d2850c7b996e6b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:042fa2151bf2093f79c9a1f556426b8aa1a009ab4169f913d606ab708dd20689"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "海隅遼右，福祿所在。柔嘉義禮，九夷何咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ef0e0f751ef7fe946c1b31772f73a0153904c82acadcd943c6cf819afaa5115e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8590e407c36eadc0ffa97fb85c1b4b37f31dddbabd071b5aa831625178a3eec1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "陽春生長，萬物茂壯。垂秋布葉，君子比德。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dfed05b24de3d4c969b723f4299968877465aea2bf8938d1ff7ea6232a9a3c1d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7b3dba534feca9025661d33b6d3cbc71642288d772ee13498f26f75439c03eb0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "低頭竊視，有所畏避。行作不利，酒酸魚敗。眾莫貪嗜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2d337fd14493151e643e3ae5f2c86d7ad7334b10a6ac3598de93eead4dda0dd4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9760e7c6feaf2cc08fd2d06e6851d308961ae1fa4664cffebce0078e3b7e9026"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "左輔右弼，金玉滿堂。常盈不亡，富如敖倉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c77d084f036662bbecd7aa02b23d77e36b56e7dcf20b7cd424a42d99104dcbda",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:66696d1e1a82b2d9a1b1fe4e28d83adafdbd8dc68c2d4d7f1182ffc3f1925d36"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "坐朝垂軒，據德宰民。虞叔受命，六合和親。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8117e8a65fd1a5931c90b0448f435876b33c576a8f6094f2ce39a7fb9740049b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:93b2be042f66256becdd09fb48862d27f319d38f116fe36a824517f1eec3dc48"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "東行西走，喪其犬馬。南求驊騮，失車林下。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:519e116deb5e0d800a0d6125d7a3614b06f4cad59dd14a57c9c1f2a1feee1d14",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:edae1204af8010cc25ae589311dedc9f955934b5cb450a8237fefaf8bc37bd26"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "砥德礪材，果當成周。拜受大命，封為齊侯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eb8051dc79c4d40a94893b4bbe8ea594cbc604208591e84d99a1831abb858108",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b4bc6bf941265d1b6423e86a50050f088d8edf67046ebfecabb4ef75224e4139"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "西逢王母，慈我九子。相對歡喜，王孫萬戶。家蒙福祉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a9539ce37996a2876393ef3502775d37f0a4d08a36b6dc66ae14d4fe7cf4d5a1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:074393d07696bd48ffbd03d5ba567679e6becdffc9e1781e4e2e1c6200cad652"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "安坐玉床，聽韶行觴。飲福萬歲，曰壽無疆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:780cc0048f188c26406e7aecdd34631216702d4915de8b3c31e396235ad3c6f8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ff3e2c104cab6cf17fa081d2e58f13caf20667a6872eddc6ecb14137b98a61dc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "登高望家，役事未休。王事靡盬，不得逍遙。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e84eaf3640d787787355df359a9d39e43b7250ba5ab4f23fbf6b933fb3205a98",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:90e2f8e6b4b9ed07860e11cd50e938b2a1317ace25af6dfb3eeeb0e630cd8834"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "擊鼓陷陔，不得相踰。章甫文德，福厭禍消。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:198a066cbdcfc08a9f495e9fd8248a72ed72aabb18f075c8d263d4ee88294e2d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5dd4362170041635ae45ced7709d9a0173c52574894e54f2d16d245c66053747"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "追亡逐北，呼還幼叔。至止而德，復歸其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1ccf63cbec128a10b5ca74f517cbea558936efcca3042eddfbfcdfeb9ae7e3c4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1a66a793bfca329be1bc2de1287ce0f649682ecfbda4ddf5bc7441e444d6d6a2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "老猾大偷，東行盜珠。困於噬敖，幾不得去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fd30ea6b76d1a83a33b7bfd4aae4029d6e1ba611bb9120b78897ba1dae54eb8e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7f1adf90861c52a367d7889388568bba5ce41543d2c82b81a7bf44d6e129fd72"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "禹召諸神，南山會稽。執玉萬國，天下康寧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:51663616b01f41d83209204066f5e3a9a0ae4c4e481c8e257b6c1c270c10473d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1f2ad7318f48995b8aff5956ed20dcaab05abcc79b825f8ffed30ab06d865845"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "忉忉怛怛，如將不活。黍稷之恩，靈輒以存。獲生保年。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e492625a6ed53acc3cb8693a962468cffe8555e22e4fff2c54bb880a2a22abb3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:02c5ca46cdbc8ac3feecd4fbb701423bc1f419d0242616dc90226496a3f19df8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "俟叔興起，季子富有。照臨楚國，蠻荊是安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:312edecc69fdfd426d84478f69ceae3848f151d4cadc6055cebfb9a78dc20c06",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4c2bc55fda1cd56c780e482d8a57295f20f55e25c241bc544878e994b2c84731"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "白馬駿騮，更生不休。富我商人，利得如丘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:702061bbc87be37818c3fb3139716ae48f2c4a2397b52ff0e13f12840e28be06",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:db98aebccd9f8093f555880c4872278aefe66a5554e31ea1f767b8167f994ba8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "灼火泉源，釣魴山巔。魚不可得，火不肯燃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:84851ba000da2d3f858a0df10d67d9efcbebed4e251f0e7e3b27bdbfb58e5169",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:59b1ec8077c241dbcf29d488245929b4847dd10f53fc68a10dca319cefcd92ef"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "避患東西，反入禍門。糟糠不足，憂動我心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:db52ab86d119e78a3ea6cfa745950c54c7641f24b347c99fe2d4cd6e92baf72a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1ea86328a4f0c9bad585306f0ee601826256d7b7859784562a763d16f58e2bb8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "我王多寵，商人惶恐。生其禍心，使我危殆。終無災咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6358f03af97009b6ac940da193a523b65df60ff36ee6298cfe422458d98c8e88",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d3e86f1d6b7bfeeb9e1cbffa1b63621cbe69f0510d88963118409c46ad99eb2b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "虎飢欲食，見蝟而伏。禹通龍門，避咎除禍。元醜以安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4661f263db84f615f7350b1587374b43cecfffacbcec906295acc6bade22782a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f4e860e5af541fed0a057cb45c55b42a4e5f4720cf056fffa8994042b5621231"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "安民呼池，玉杯大案。泉如白蜜，一挹獲願。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f635722135345713fe161d0f886254b9fbed766840d8314f1ec6f3043795d1d6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2e924dc82a1a2b0baae4961fecc12631d54b2d91ded235625403ba4669be577a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "雙鳧鴛鴦，相隨群行。南至饒澤，食魚與粱。君子樂長。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9456cf902d9e6d21911c4609907d237d104a8bf58e239fd444d29367671fdf9b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f3891e3be5bd79f187e8c4f8162ec7570a9190b9c601248fb24b2631c2fc6900"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "蔡侯朝楚，留連江渚。踰時歷月，思其君后。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:27e010edbd852b46123abe966e4e2fd47cbe607711fdd25e51a15009785cd4c0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:705079608e7b20d58d9d10bb058f9c267590f596d8eff8c8a623f0b90b1558fd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "驂車駕東，與雨相逢。五楘解墮，頹杌獨坐。憂為身禍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a3248edfb255228d75b671622a0da79b89ef549425b876494dcff28600450720",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c1c88182382b185a40a210d67b8bb8c28a2e0d957f0a1b53ce76e7029d09004e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 50,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "螟蟲為賊，害我稼穡。盡禾殫麥，秋無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1c28978db8114531d44c660d4a9705026cb2141d50fe6d751e5916c2330502a4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:43f7e60fcaeeb18476f34e2311507bcde9c8ea7b950ac8fc808a8dad41e022e6"
    }
  ]
}
